1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,320
Franklin never patented his lightning rod.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,240
He wanted everyone to have it.

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,980
Within a few years, rods were going up on churches,

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,900
houses, and ships' masts,

5
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:14,660
and one by one, church towers became safer places to stand.
